  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a maintainer, I want ADR 0013's appendix E and the `SettingKey` doc comments to match the code key by key, so that nobody reads a storage decision wrong. Leftovers found by Fable while reviewing PR #862.\n\n### Scope\n\n1. `Packages/HFRKit/Sources/HFRStorage/Settings/SettingKey.swift:71`: the doc comment of `appIconPrevious` says \"app-chosen dated icon\". The app never picks an icon: the user does, in `AppIconSettingsModel.select` (`App/SwiftHFR/Settings/AppIconSettingsModel.swift:75-97`). Reword it as the ADR now does (#862).\n2. ADR 0013 appendix E has no row for `app_lock_enabled` or `app_lock_grace_seconds` (LOT-173), which the `SettingScopeTests` matrix lists. Add both rows with their scope as the tests state it.\n\nTo do in the next PR that touches `SettingKey.swift`, or alone: it is trivial.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] The doc comment is reworded.\n- [ ] Both `app_lock_*` rows are in the ADR, with the scope matching `SettingScopeTests`.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
